# ============================================================
# WeKnora 插件集合 - Git 忽略规则
#
# 编译产物（Go 静态二进制）每个 15~40MB，可由源码用 go build 随时
# 重新生成，因此不进入版本库。源码本身只有约 13MB。
# ============================================================

# --- 各插件的 Linux 二进制（无扩展名）---
# 用完整路径精确匹配，避免误伤同名的插件目录本身。
datasource/weknora-plugin-dingtalk/weknora-plugin-dingtalk
datasource/weknora-plugin-github/weknora-plugin-github
datasource/weknora-plugin-localdir/weknora-plugin-localdir
model/weknora-plugin-DS/weknora-plugin-ds
parser/weknora-plugin-builtinb/builtinb
retriever/weknora-plugin-milvux/weknora-plugin-milvux
search/weknora-plugin-tarily/weknora-plugin-tarily
search/weknora-plugin-tarily123/weknora-plugin-tarily

# --- Windows 二进制 ---
*.exe

# --- 通用构建产物 ---
bin/
dist/
build/
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.test
*.out
*.log
